{"3849030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tired of Being the Hero", "steam_appid": 3849030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>You saved the world. Now you just want to chop wood. But monsters don’t retire, and neither can you.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Tired of Being the Hero</strong></i> is a first-person dark fantasy RPG with a management twist. As a retired hero, protect your village not just with your sword, but by inspiring villagers to become heroes of their own. Train peasants into warriors, raise morale, and stand together against monsters that refuse to let you fade into memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Retirement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay down your sword. Chop wood, haul wagons, and try to live as a simple villager. But a hero’s past doesn’t stay buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Give Your Villagers Names</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get to know the locals of the village. Give them nicknames to form a closer bond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up and Motivate Your Allies by Raising Morale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight and protect the villagers to raise morale. Spend that morale to increase their level. Teach them new abilities, shift their roles, and work together to survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test Your Villagers Against Powerful Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larger and more dangerous enemies will threaten your villagers. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>You saved the world. Now you just want to chop wood. But monsters don’t retire, and neither can you.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Tired of Being the Hero</strong></i> is a first-person dark fantasy RPG with a management twist. As a retired hero, protect your village not just with your sword, but by inspiring villagers to become heroes of their own. Train peasants into warriors, raise morale, and stand together against monsters that refuse to let you fade into memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Retirement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay down your sword. Chop wood, haul wagons, and try to live as a simple villager. But a hero’s past doesn’t stay buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Give Your Villagers Names</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get to know the locals of the village. Give them nicknames to form a closer bond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up and Motivate Your Allies by Raising Morale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight and protect the villagers to raise morale. Spend that morale to increase their level. Teach them new abilities, shift their roles, and work together to survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test Your Villagers Against Powerful Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.poster.avif?t=1788121983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.webm?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.mp4?t=1788121983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larger and more dangerous enemies will threaten your villagers. </p>", "short_description": "As a retired hero, lead and train your villagers to stand against relentless monster attacks. Assign roles, motivate your team, upgrade townsfolk, unlock powerful abilities, and adapt your strategy to outlast the next assault. TBH is a first-person fantasy action RPG with a strategy twist.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/af8bcf83420bea1046ddccb46ec2a52da07ac4a3/header.jpg?t=1788121983", "capsule_image": "https://shared